(883, 1, '2026-03-19 11:08:05', '2026-03-19 11:08:05', '<h1>Welcome to Exoga Tech</h1>					<h2>Your Premier IT Support Partner</h2>		Empower your business with Exoga Tech, your reliable partner in IT solutions. We specialize in providing comprehensive IT support services that are customized to align with the specific needs of your business. Whether you are a startup, a small business, or a large enterprise, Exoga ensures your technology runs smoothly, enabling you to concentrate on what you do best—growing and succeeding in your industry.								<a href=\"/contact-us\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"/apply-to-work-with-us\">\n									Get Started\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"431\" height=\"442\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/people-working-e1773900087818.webp\" alt=\"People Working\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/people-working-e1773900087818.webp 431w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/people-working-e1773900087818-293x300.webp 293w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 431px) 100vw, 431px\" />																		\n							<h2>Why Choose Exoga Tech?</h2>							\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M223.75 130.75L154.62 15.54A31.997 31.997 0 0 0 127.18 0H16.03C3.08 0-4.5 14.57 2.92 25.18l111.27 158.96c29.72-27.77 67.52-46.83 109.56-53.39zM495.97 0H384.82c-11.24 0-21.66 5.9-27.44 15.54l-69.13 115.21c42.04 6.56 79.84 25.62 109.56 53.38L509.08 25.18C516.5 14.57 508.92 0 495.97 0zM256 160c-97.2 0-176 78.8-176 176s78.8 176 176 176 176-78.8 176-176-78.8-176-176-176zm92.52 157.26l-37.93 36.96 8.97 52.22c1.6 9.36-8.26 16.51-16.65 12.09L256 393.88l-46.9 24.65c-8.4 4.45-18.25-2.74-16.65-12.09l8.97-52.22-37.93-36.96c-6.82-6.64-3.05-18.23 6.35-19.59l52.43-7.64 23.43-47.52c2.11-4.28 6.19-6.39 10.28-6.39 4.11 0 8.22 2.14 10.33 6.39l23.43 47.52 52.43 7.64c9.4 1.36 13.17 12.95 6.35 19.59z\"></path></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Expertise						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						With years of experience in the industry, our team brings unparalleled expertise to every project. You can trust us to deliver innovative solutions that drive your business forward.					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M192 208c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32h-16c-35.35 0-64 28.65-64 64v48c0 35.35 28.65 64 64 64h16c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V208zm176 144c35.35 0 64-28.65 64-64v-48c0-35.35-28.65-64-64-64h-16c-17.67 0-32 14.33-32 32v112c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h16zM256 0C113.18 0 4.58 118.83 0 256v16c0 8.84 7.16 16 16 16h16c8.84 0 16-7.16 16-16v-16c0-114.69 93.31-208 208-208s208 93.31 208 208h-.12c.08 2.43.12 165.72.12 165.72 0 23.35-18.93 42.28-42.28 42.28H320c0-26.51-21.49-48-48-48h-32c-26.51 0-48 21.49-48 48s21.49 48 48 48h181.72c49.86 0 90.28-40.42 90.28-90.28V256C507.42 118.83 398.82 0 256 0z\"></path></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Customer-Centric Approach						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						We put our customers first. Our dedicated support team is committed to providing exceptional service and personalized solutions to meet your specific needs.					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M496 384H64V80c0-8.84-7.16-16-16-16H16C7.16 64 0 71.16 0 80v336c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h464c8.84 0 16-7.16 16-16v-32c0-8.84-7.16-16-16-16zM464 96H345.94c-21.38 0-32.09 25.85-16.97 40.97l32.4 32.4L288 242.75l-73.37-73.37c-12.5-12.5-32.76-12.5-45.25 0l-68.69 68.69c-6.25 6.25-6.25 16.38 0 22.63l22.62 22.62c6.25 6.25 16.38 6.25 22.63 0L192 237.25l73.37 73.37c12.5 12.5 32.76 12.5 45.25 0l96-96 32.4 32.4c15.12 15.12 40.97 4.41 40.97-16.97V112c.01-8.84-7.15-16-15.99-16z\"></path></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Scalability						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						As your business grows, so do your IT requirements. Our scalable solutions are designed to grow with you, ensuring that your technology infrastructure can keep pace with your expanding business.					</p>\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 288 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M209.2 233.4l-108-31.6C88.7 198.2 80 186.5 80 173.5c0-16.3 13.2-29.5 29.5-29.5h66.3c12.2 0 24.2 3.7 34.2 10.5 6.1 4.1 14.3 3.1 19.5-2l34.8-34c7.1-6.9 6.1-18.4-1.8-24.5C238 74.8 207.4 64.1 176 64V16c0-8.8-7.2-16-16-16h-32c-8.8 0-16 7.2-16 16v48h-2.5C45.8 64-5.4 118.7.5 183.6c4.2 46.1 39.4 83.6 83.8 96.6l102.5 30c12.5 3.7 21.2 15.3 21.2 28.3 0 16.3-13.2 29.5-29.5 29.5h-66.3C100 368 88 364.3 78 357.5c-6.1-4.1-14.3-3.1-19.5 2l-34.8 34c-7.1 6.9-6.1 18.4 1.8 24.5 24.5 19.2 55.1 29.9 86.5 30v48c0 8.8 7.2 16 16 16h32c8.8 0 16-7.2 16-16v-48.2c46.6-.9 90.3-28.6 105.7-72.7 21.5-61.6-14.6-124.8-72.5-141.7z\"></path></svg>				\n									<h3>\n							Cost-Effective						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						We understand the importance of value for money. That’s why our services are competitively priced, offering you high-quality IT support without breaking the bank.					</p>\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M272 0H48C21.5 0 0 21.5 0 48v416c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h224c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V48c0-26.5-21.5-48-48-48zM160 480c-17.7 0-32-14.3-32-32s14.3-32 32-32 32 14.3 32 32-14.3 32-32 32zm112-108c0 6.6-5.4 12-12 12H60c-6.6 0-12-5.4-12-12V60c0-6.6 5.4-12 12-12h200c6.6 0 12 5.4 12 12v312z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Fast &amp; Responsive</h3>		On-site within 4 to 24 hours everywhere in Europe.								<a href=\"#\">\n									Support times by countries\n					</a>\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M12.41 148.02l232.94 105.67c6.8 3.09 14.49 3.09 21.29 0l232.94-105.67c16.55-7.51 16.55-32.52 0-40.03L266.65 2.31a25.607 25.607 0 0 0-21.29 0L12.41 107.98c-16.55 7.51-16.55 32.53 0 40.04zm487.18 88.28l-58.09-26.33-161.64 73.27c-7.56 3.43-15.59 5.17-23.86 5.17s-16.29-1.74-23.86-5.17L70.51 209.97l-58.1 26.33c-16.55 7.5-16.55 32.5 0 40l232.94 105.59c6.8 3.08 14.49 3.08 21.29 0L499.59 276.3c16.55-7.5 16.55-32.5 0-40zm0 127.8l-57.87-26.23-161.86 73.37c-7.56 3.43-15.59 5.17-23.86 5.17s-16.29-1.74-23.86-5.17L70.29 337.87 12.41 364.1c-16.55 7.5-16.55 32.5 0 40l232.94 105.59c6.8 3.08 14.49 3.08 21.29 0L499.59 404.1c16.55-7.5 16.55-32.5 0-40z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>Skill &amp; experience</h3>		Qualified engineers supporting our clients for over 25 years								<a href=\"#\">\n									Reasons to work with us\n					</a>\n			<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M608 32H32C14.33 32 0 46.33 0 64v384c0 17.67 14.33 32 32 32h576c17.67 0 32-14.33 32-32V64c0-17.67-14.33-32-32-32zM176 327.88V344c0 4.42-3.58 8-8 8h-16c-4.42 0-8-3.58-8-8v-16.29c-11.29-.58-22.27-4.52-31.37-11.35-3.9-2.93-4.1-8.77-.57-12.14l11.75-11.21c2.77-2.64 6.89-2.76 10.13-.73 3.87 2.42 8.26 3.72 12.82 3.72h28.11c6.5 0 11.8-5.92 11.8-13.19 0-5.95-3.61-11.19-8.77-12.73l-45-13.5c-18.59-5.58-31.58-23.42-31.58-43.39 0-24.52 19.05-44.44 42.67-45.07V152c0-4.42 3.58-8 8-8h16c4.42 0 8 3.58 8 8v16.29c11.29.58 22.27 4.51 31.37 11.35 3.9 2.93 4.1 8.77.57 12.14l-11.75 11.21c-2.77 2.64-6.89 2.76-10.13.73-3.87-2.43-8.26-3.72-12.82-3.72h-28.11c-6.5 0-11.8 5.92-11.8 13.19 0 5.95 3.61 11.19 8.77 12.73l45 13.5c18.59 5.58 31.58 23.42 31.58 43.39 0 24.53-19.05 44.44-42.67 45.07zM416 312c0 4.42-3.58 8-8 8H296c-4.42 0-8-3.58-8-8v-16c0-4.42 3.58-8 8-8h112c4.42 0 8 3.58 8 8v16zm160 0c0 4.42-3.58 8-8 8h-80c-4.42 0-8-3.58-8-8v-16c0-4.42 3.58-8 8-8h80c4.42 0 8 3.58 8 8v16zm0-96c0 4.42-3.58 8-8 8H296c-4.42 0-8-3.58-8-8v-16c0-4.42 3.58-8 8-8h272c4.42 0 8 3.58 8 8v16z\"></path></svg>			\n							<h3>On time &amp; in budget</h3>		Our mantra for every customer – you can have it all								<a href=\"#\">\n									Our references\n					</a>\n									<h5>Our Services</h5>					<h2>We Provide The Best Service For You</h2>															<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/online-support.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/online-support.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/online-support-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/online-support-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/online-support-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							Workplace Technology Deployment						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						We support office technology deployments for new office setups, renovations, and workplace upgrades. Our technicians install and configure workstations, monitors, peripherals, and meeting room technology to ensure every workspace is fully operational from day one.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/help-desk.png\" alt=\"Help Desk\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/help-desk.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/help-desk-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/help-desk-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/help-desk-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							Smart Building &amp; Sensor Installations						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Our team installs and configures smart building technology including occupancy sensors and IoT devices that help organizations monitor space utilization, improve energy efficiency, and optimize workplace environments.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cyber-security.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cyber-security.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cyber-security-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cyber-security-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cyber-security-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							Structured Cabling &amp; Network Infrastructure						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						We design and install reliable network infrastructure for office environments. Our services include structured cabling, fiber installation, rack setup, and network equipment installation to support modern workplace connectivity.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/settings.png\" alt=\"Settings\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/settings.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/settings-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/settings-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/settings-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							AV &amp; Meeting Room Installations						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						We install and configure modern meeting room technology including video conferencing systems, displays, and collaboration tools that enable effective communication in hybrid workplaces.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cloud.png\" alt=\"Cloud\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cloud.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cloud-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cloud-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cloud-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							Workplace Project Delivery &amp; Consulting						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Our project management team supports complex workplace technology rollouts across multiple locations. From planning and vendor coordination to onsite execution, we ensure projects are delivered on time and with minimal disruption to operations.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Hire-Dedicated.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Hire-Dedicated.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Hire-Dedicated-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Hire-Dedicated-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Hire-Dedicated-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							Hire Dedicated Developers						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Determine your own team for software development with the flexibility of choosing short-term, long-term, or permanent basis at affordable prices.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/web-development.png\" alt=\"Web Development\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/web-development.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/web-development-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/web-development-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/web-development-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							Web Development						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Transform your business solutions with our most innovative web development services. We help you take your business up to the next level with the most contemporary web technology.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Application.png\" alt=\"Mobile Application\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Application.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Application-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Application-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Application-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							Mobile Application Development						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Develop intuitive, scalable, engaging &amp; future-rich mobile applications for businesses using Android, IOS.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/UI-UX-Design.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/UI-UX-Design.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/UI-UX-Design-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/UI-UX-Design-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/UI-UX-Design-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							 UX/ UI Design						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						From the beginning of a business concept and information architecture to the visualization &amp; prototypes, our team offers an exciting experience to the end user.					</p>\n			Installs in the past year			\n				+\n			Customer satisfaction Rate			\n				/5\n			UK, EU &amp; U.S coverage			\n				+\n							<h2>Our Partner</h2>							\n								<figure><img src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/partner-1.png\" alt=\"Partner-1\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/partner-2.png\" alt=\"Partner-2\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/partner-3.png\" alt=\"Partner-3\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/partner-4.png\" alt=\"Partner-4\" /></figure>', 'New Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '670-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-03-19 11:08:05', '2026-03-19 11:08:05', '', 670, 'http://exogatech.acutetest.com/?p=883', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
