12\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/online-support.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/online-support.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/online-support-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/online-support-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/online-support-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							Workplace Technology Deployment						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						We support office technology deployments for new office setups, renovations, and workplace upgrades. Our technicians install and configure workstations, monitors, peripherals, and meeting room technology to ensure every workspace is fully operational from day one.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/help-desk.png\" alt=\"Help Desk\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/help-desk.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/help-desk-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/help-desk-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/help-desk-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							Smart Building &amp; Sensor Installations						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Our team installs and configures smart building technology including occupancy sensors and IoT devices that help organizations monitor space utilization, improve energy efficiency, and optimize workplace environments.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cyber-security.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cyber-security.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cyber-security-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cyber-security-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cyber-security-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							Structured Cabling &amp; Network Infrastructure						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						We design and install reliable network infrastructure for office environments. Our services include structured cabling, fiber installation, rack setup, and network equipment installation to support modern workplace connectivity.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/settings.png\" alt=\"Settings\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/settings.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/settings-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/settings-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/settings-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							AV &amp; Meeting Room Installations						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						We install and configure modern meeting room technology including video conferencing systems, displays, and collaboration tools that enable effective communication in hybrid workplaces.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cloud.png\" alt=\"Cloud\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cloud.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cloud-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cloud-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/cloud-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							Workplace Project Delivery &amp; Consulting						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Our project management team supports complex workplace technology rollouts across multiple locations. From planning and vendor coordination to onsite execution, we ensure projects are delivered on time and with minimal disruption to operations.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Hire-Dedicated.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Hire-Dedicated.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Hire-Dedicated-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Hire-Dedicated-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Hire-Dedicated-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							Hire Dedicated Developers						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Determine your own team for software development with the flexibility of choosing short-term, long-term, or permanent basis at affordable prices.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/web-development.png\" alt=\"Web Development\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/web-development.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/web-development-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/web-development-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/web-development-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							Web Development						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Transform your business solutions with our most innovative web development services. We help you take your business up to the next level with the most contemporary web technology.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Application.png\" alt=\"Mobile Application\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Application.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Application-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Application-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/Mobile-Application-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							Mobile Application Development						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						Develop intuitive, scalable, engaging &amp; future-rich mobile applications for businesses using Android, IOS.					</p>\n																	<img width=\"512\" height=\"512\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/UI-UX-Design.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/UI-UX-Design.png 512w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/UI-UX-Design-300x300.png 300w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/UI-UX-Design-150x150.png 150w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/UI-UX-Design-500x500.png 500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 512px) 100vw, 512px\" />																		\n									<h3>\n							 UX/ UI Design						\n					</h3>\n									<p>\n						From the beginning of a business concept and information architecture to the visualization &amp; prototypes, our team offers an exciting experience to the end user.					</p>\n			Installs in the past year			\n				+\n			Customer satisfaction Rate			\n				/5\n			UK, EU &amp; U.S coverage			\n				+\n							<h2>Our Partners</h2>							\n								<figure><img src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/partner-1.png\" alt=\"Partner-1\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/partner-2.png\" alt=\"Partner-2\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/partner-3.png\" alt=\"Partner-3\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/partner-4.png\" alt=\"Partner-4\" /></figure>			\n				[contact-form-7 id=\"21f48e1\" title=\"Home-page-form\"]			<h2>Get in Touch</h2>		Ready to take your IT infrastructure to the next level? Contact us today to learn more about how Exoga Tech can help your business succeed. With our expertise and dedication, we’ll ensure that your technology works for you, not against you. Experience the Exoga Tech difference and elevate your business to new heights.								<a href=\"/contact-us\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>', 'New Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '670-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-03-19 13:08:59', '2026-03-19 13:08:59', '', 670, 'http://exogatech.acutetest.com/?p=966', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(967, 1, '2026-03-19 13:09:00', '2026-03-19 13:09:00', '<h1>Welcome to Exoga Tech</h1>					<h2>Your Premier IT Support Partner</h2>		Empower your business with Exoga Tech, your reliable partner in IT solutions. We specialize in providing comprehensive IT support services that are customized to align with the specific needs of your business. Whether you are a startup, a small business, or a large enterprise, Exoga ensures your technology runs smoothly, enabling you to concentrate on what you do best—growing and succeeding in your industry.								<a href=\"/contact-us\">\n									Contact Us\n					</a>\n														<a href=\"/apply-to-work-with-us\">\n									Get Started\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"431\" height=\"442\" src=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/people-working-e1773900087818.webp\" alt=\"People Working\" srcset=\"http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/people-working-e1773900087818.webp 431w, http://exogatech.acutetest.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/people-working-e1773900087818-293x300.webp 293w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 431px) 100vw, 431px\" />																		\n							<h2>Why Choose Exoga Tech?</h2>							\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M223.75 130.75L154.62 15.54A31.997 31.997 0 0 0 127.18 0H16.03C3.08 0-4.5 14.57 2.92 25.18l111.27 158.96c29.72-27.77 67.52-46.83 109.56-53.39zM495.97 0H384.82c-11.24 0-21.66 5.9-27.44 15.54l-69.13 115.21c42.04 6.56 79.84 25.62 109.56 53.38L509.08 25.18C516.5 14.57 508.92 0 495.97 0zM256 160c-97.2 0-176 78.8-176 176s78.8 176 176 176 176-78.8 176-176-78.8-176-176-176zm92.52 157.26l-37.93 36.96 8.97 52.22c1.6 9.36-8.26 16.51-16.65 12.09L256 393.88l-46.9 24.65c-8.4 4.45-18.25-2.74-16.65-12.09l8.97-52.22-37.93-36.96c-6.82-6.64-3.05-18.23 6.35-19.59l52.43-7.64 23.43-47.52c2.11-4.28 6.19-6.39 10.28-6.39 4.11 0 8.22 2.14 10.33 6.39l23.43 47.52 52.43 7.64c9.4 1.36 13.17 12.95 6.35 19.59z\"></path></sv